@name     step_get
@alias    xg
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_step_get
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  get pattern step source string
@doc
Loads source program string from pattern step into parser string buffer.
Usage: xg step
@code
    return skode_exec_xg(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
